Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.89,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.89,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he just broke\NCaptain Kuro's cat claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves only five more\Nof those weird swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys, he\Ncan still fight plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he still has another\Nclaw. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip that cat or shrimp, Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't use that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think in this village his name\Nis Call something Call something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out you brats I know you're\Nhiding give yourselves up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here and we'll take you to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You silly rugrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into the line, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you bit off a little\Nmore than you could chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:03:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates don't take kindly to\Nbeing mocked by the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pretend pirates sure got\Nin over your heads, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich girl, I know you're\Nhere. Listen, unless you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,show yourself I'll\Nexecute these three little
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lambs and I will make\Nsure to do it in a most
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,painful fashion do not\Ndoubt my skill at such a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my task.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's them all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, I'll deal with you\Nin the only appropriate manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extermination!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll also kill that fool, Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:05:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why kill us, Captain? Come on, please\Ndon't talk around like that, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not too late for us to attack\Nthe village right yeah and if captain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungle gets her to write her will then\Nyour plan should still work perfectly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This plan is no longer any of\Nyour concern when all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are dead this Village will know\Nwho to blame for this atrocity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never intended to let any of you\Nmongrels leave this village alive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one who knows my true identity can\Nbe allowed to live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had already planned to kill every\Nlast one of us from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago I planned to erase Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuro And every last\Nperson who ever knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the most Uncle pirates I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Uncle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are nothing more than savages,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,incapable of rising above\Ntheir animal nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without my plans, what could\Nthey possibly accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crew is nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are simply a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crew members are just pawns\Nin the captain's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether my men live or die\Nis up to me and me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I tell them to fight, they will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I order them to\Ndie, they had better do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know the punishment for disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how pirates are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare talk down to me, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how many hundreds or thousands\Nof men follow you as their captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will never be as good as Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that I am inferior\Nto a kid pretending to be a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get all cocky just because\Nyou snapped off one of my cat claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly is he better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause he's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy like you doesn't\Nknow what a true pirate is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible he kept up with\Nthe pussyfoot maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear that you need a\Nlesson in what real pirates are like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not pleasant. Your first\Nlesson will be about terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terror a lesson I learned\Nwell as I stared Down death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, should he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in that stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he using that technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only fighting one guy. There's no\Nreason to use the out of the back attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a good spot for us\NI mean he could get us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah he did say he was gonna kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Captain Kaido,\Nanything but that technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Captain Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just swaying back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the back attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a small haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I really thought they'd\Nhave more treasure than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if the boys have\Nfinished this fight yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't reason with it\Nnow that he's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His sidestep maneuver is so fast,\Nnot even he knows what he's cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how could he have killed\Nso many of us without even...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are just getting cut to ribbons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoo yourself, butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those men are friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have accepted\Nyour fate like a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my little pawns\Nare still alive and in misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been better just\Nto let them die in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have something to say? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you can't be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you are going to die here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave the children be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll write the will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill you as\Nsoon as you write that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly girl, don't you know\Nyou can't bargain with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro specifically instructed\Nme to get rid of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't do exactly as I say,\Nthen you won't get to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aunt, I won't write my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I absolutely have to get\Nyou to write that will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll let the little brats go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in their condition, they won't\Nbe making too quick of a getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to sign your name. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave my entire fortune\Nto my butler, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your will, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, remember, we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised me you wouldn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax. I know I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may not look like it, but I'm\Nregarded as an honest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaia! There! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that hypno-freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the girl go! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I was followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'd better finish off\Nthe rich girl quickly, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was simply a war move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real fight begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I will be feasting on your feet,\NComplimented by the sweet water of your agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the back attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try you jerk damn you get away\Nfrom me Wow Butler man right now your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life really sucks Your plan of three\Nyears is a complete and total failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, that weird\Nkid called Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that goofy kid manages to beat him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that means Captain Kuro won't\Nbe able to slaughter us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid snot-nosed brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're one\Nstep too late, swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That branch was getting\Nin the way of my shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat this, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, you crazy rubber guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going dead, you mean bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to cheer me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time for the exploding star!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bird will absolutely not be disrupted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When everything's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

